#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7.rst:80
msgid ""
"The **SYN** pad on the header is connected directly to the camera sensor's "
"trigger / exposure line — it does **not** route to the MCU on the H7. Drive "
"or read it externally; you can't toggle it from MicroPython."
msgstr ""
"接腳排上的 **SYN** 焊墊直接連接至相機感測器的觸發／曝光線——在 H7 上它\\ **不會**\\ 連到 MCU。請從外部驅動或讀取它；你無法從"
" MicroPython 切換它。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7.rst:86
msgid "Power pins"
msgstr "電源接腳"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7.rst:88
msgid ""
"**3.3V** — regulated 3.3 V rail. Up to 250 mA available for shields (less if"
" the microSD card is in use). Unlike the newer cameras this pin is "
"bidirectional — see the warning below."
msgstr ""
"**3.3V**\\ ——穩壓後的 3.3 V 電源軌。最多可供 250 mA 給擴充板使用（若 microSD "
"卡正在使用中則較少）。與較新的相機不同，此接腳為雙向——請參閱下方的警告。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7.rst:91
msgid ""
"**VIN** — 3.6 – 5 V input. Powers the board through the on‑board regulator."
msgstr "**VIN**\\ ——3.6 – 5 V 輸入。透過板載穩壓器為開發板供電。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7.rst:93
msgid "**GND** — common ground."
msgstr "**GND**\\ ——共用接地。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7.rst:95
msgid ""
"A 3.7 V LiPo connector is also present, but **the H7 does not have a battery"
" charger** — connect a pre‑charged cell, or supply VIN / USB instead."
msgstr ""
"板上同時也有一個 3.7 V LiPo 接頭，但 **H7 並沒有電池充電器**\\ ——請接入已充電的電池芯，或改以 VIN / USB 供電。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7.rst:101
msgid ""
"When both USB and VIN/LiPo are present, the **VIN/LiPo input wins** — the "
"on‑board power switch picks it over USB to power the board."
msgstr ""
"當 USB 與 VIN/LiPo 同時存在時，\\ **VIN/LiPo 輸入會優先採用**\\ ——板載電源切換器會選擇它而非 USB "
"來為開發板供電。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7.rst:106
msgid ""
"The **battery connector and VIN are tied together** on the H7. Do **not** "
"plug in a LiPo and apply VIN at the same time — the two supplies will fight "
"each other and can damage the battery, the board, or both."
msgstr ""
"H7 上的\\ **電池接頭與 VIN 是相連在一起的**\\ 。請\\ **勿**\\ 同時插入 LiPo 並施加 "
"VIN——這兩路電源會互相衝突，可能損壞電池、開發板，或兩者皆損壞。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7.rst:113
msgid ""
"You **may** power the H7 by feeding 3.3 V directly into the ``3.3V`` pin if "
"you don't want to go through the on‑board regulator. In that case, **do not "
"also apply VIN or USB power at the same time** — back‑driving the regulator "
"while another supply is active can permanently damage and destroy the "
"camera."
msgstr ""
"如果你不想經過板載穩壓器，\\ **可以**\\ 直接將 3.3 V 饋入 ``3.3V`` 接腳來為 H7 供電。在這種情況下，\\ **請勿同時施加"
" VIN 或 USB 電源**\\ ——當另一路電源在作用時反向驅動穩壓器，可能會永久損壞並毀掉相機。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7.rst:121
msgid ""
"Use the :doc:`battery life estimator <../tutorial/tools/battery-life-"
"estimator>` to model how long the H7 will run on a battery for a given "
"active / deep-sleep duty cycle."
msgstr ""
"使用 :doc:`電池續航估算器 <../tutorial/tools/battery-life-estimator>` 來推算 H7 "
"在給定的作用／深度睡眠工作週期下，依靠電池可運作多久。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7.rst:126
msgid "Recovery and debug pins"
msgstr "回復與除錯接腳"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7.rst:128
msgid ""
"**RESET** — pull to GND to reset the board. Releasing it lets the MCU start "
"up normally."
msgstr "**RESET**\\ ——拉至 GND 以重置開發板。放開後即可讓 MCU 正常啟動。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7.rst:130
msgid ""
"**BOOT0** — pull to 3.3 V while powering the board to enter the STM32 ROM "
"bootloader (DFU mode). OpenMV IDE uses this mode to reflash the on‑board "
"bootloader."
msgstr ""
"**BOOT0**\\ ——在為開發板供電時拉至 3.3 V，即可進入 STM32 ROM 開機載入程式（DFU 模式）。OpenMV IDE "
"利用此模式來重新燒錄板載開機載入程式。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7.rst:134
msgid ""
"The board exposes an **SWD** debug header (RST / SWCLK / SWDIO) next to the "
"GPIO header, compatible with ST‑LINK and SEGGER J‑Link adapters."
msgstr ""
"開發板在 GPIO 接腳排旁另外提供一個 **SWD** 除錯接腳排（RST / SWCLK / SWDIO），相容於 ST‑LINK 與 SEGGER"
" J‑Link 轉接器。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7.rst:139
msgid "Onboard peripherals"
msgstr "板載周邊裝置"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7.rst:142
msgid "LEDs"
msgstr "LED"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7.rst:144
msgid ""
"The H7 has a single user RGB LED plus a pair of high‑power 850 nm IR LEDs:"
msgstr "H7 配有一顆使用者 RGB LED，外加一對高功率 850 nm 紅外線 LED："

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7.rst:147
msgid ""
"**User RGB LED** — software‑controllable, exposed as ``LED_RED``, "
"``LED_GREEN`` and ``LED_BLUE``::"
msgstr ""
"**使用者 RGB LED**\\ ——可由軟體控制，以 ``LED_RED``\\ 、\\ ``LED_GREEN`` 與 ``LED_BLUE`` "
"形式公開::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7.rst:156
msgid ""
"**IR LEDs** — both LEDs are driven together through the ``LED_IR`` pin. "
"``LED_IR`` is wired **active high** in hardware while the firmware treats "
"every other on‑board LED as active low, so use :meth:`~machine.Pin.low` / "
":meth:`~machine.Pin.high` rather than :meth:`~machine.LED.on` / "
":meth:`~machine.LED.off` (which would invert the sense)::"
msgstr ""
"**紅外線 LED**\\ ——兩顆 LED 透過 ``LED_IR`` 接腳一起驅動。在硬體上 ``LED_IR`` 是\\ **高電位有效**\\ "
"接線，而韌體對所有其他板載 LED 都視為低電位有效，因此請使用 :meth:`~machine.Pin.low` / "
":meth:`~machine.Pin.high`\\ ，而非 :meth:`~machine.LED.on` / "
":meth:`~machine.LED.off`\\ （後者會反轉邏輯）::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7.rst:170
msgid "Camera sensor"
msgstr "相機感測器"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7.rst:172
msgid ""
"The OV7725 (or MT9M114 on the H7 R2) is driven through the "
":doc:`/library/omv.csi` module::"
msgstr "OV7725（H7 R2 上則為 MT9M114）是透過 :doc:`/library/omv.csi` 模組來驅動的::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7.rst:186
msgid ""
"The sensor sits on a **removable module** — swap it for any of the other "
"OpenMV camera modules (global shutter, thermal, higher resolution, etc.) "
"without changing the rest of the board."
msgstr ""
"感測器位於一個\\ **可拆卸模組**\\ 上——你可以將它換成任何其他 OpenMV "
"相機模組（全域快門、熱成像、更高解析度等），而無需更動開發板的其餘部分。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7.rst:191
msgid "microSD card"
msgstr "microSD 卡"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7.rst:193
msgid ""
"When a card is inserted it is mounted automatically at ``/sdcard`` and is "
"usable through the regular file system::"
msgstr "插入卡片後，它會自動掛載於 ``/sdcard``\\ ，並可透過一般檔案系統使用::"

